                    <i class='bx bx-dollar-circle'></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Value for Money</h3>
                <p>Premium services at competitive prices. Experience luxury without breaking the bank. We offer special packages and seasonal discounts.</p>
