                    <i class='bx bxs-star'></i>
                    <i class='bx bxs-star'></i>
                    <i class='bx bxs-star'></i>
                    <i class='bx bxs-star-half'></i>
                </div>
                <p class="testimonial-text">"My experience with the facial treatment was amazing. My skin has never looked better! The staff was knowledgeable and made great recommendations."</p>
                <p class="testimonial-author">James K.</p>
