        <div class="footer-content">
            <div class="footer-info" data-aos="fade-up">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Eddah's Spa</h3>
                <p>Your destination for luxury beauty and wellness services. Experience the perfect blend of traditional and modern spa treatments.</p>
